enre","name":"Pop Rock","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":193634530822272,"name":"Brit-pop y post-pop","book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1990,"end":2001,"desc":"Como tantas veces, el fenómeno más publicitado es el menos interesante: un «brit-pop» de grupos terriblemente parecidos y tediosos, sin apenas imaginación. Lo anticipan Lightning Seeds, La's, Teenage Fanclub y Heavenly; estalla con Boo Radleys, Blur (Parklife) y Oasis (el «farol» que mejor personifica la moda). Suede y el glam-pop (Super Furry Animals, Placebo), las excepciones de High Llamas (Hawaii) y Supergrass, el revival mod (Ocean Colour Scene, Wildhearts), Elastica, Sleeper, las Spice Girls; Trembling Blue Stars, Tindersticks, Delgados. El post-pop de Radiohead, «la banda más publicitada y sobrevalorada de la década», cuyo OK Computer es una obra maestra del falso vanguardismo; Coldplay, Travis.","color":"#f472b6","family":"Pop, power-pop y synth-pop","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#britpop"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":161028061741986,"artist":"High Llamas","artist_id":120832503961239,"title":"Gideon Gaye","year":1995,"ess":0,"yt":"_JATQu8VQwg","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Brit-pop y post-pop","scene_id":193634530822272,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#britpop","chapters":["Sección 6.11"],"pages":[[1,271,null]]},{"id":136780087842548,"artist":"High Llamas","artist_id":120832503961239,"title":"Hawaii","year":1996,"ess":0,"yt":"fX16lEDzcMk","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Brit-pop y post-pop","scene_id":193634530822272,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#britpop","chapters":["Sección 6.11"],"pages":[[1,271,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":157,"text":"…were notable not so much for the fragile tunes of Everybody's Fantastic (1983) as for featuring guitarist Sean O'Hagan (who would form the High Llamas) and singer Cathal Coughlan (who would form Fatima Mansions). England 1979-88 The least creative and most predictable of folk-pop schools was…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":271,"text":"…mediocrity were few. Former Microdisney's guitarist Sean O'Hagan, proved his stature as a Brian Wilson-style arranger on the first two albums by the High Llamas (1), Gideon Gaye (1995) and especially the ambitious and monumental Hawaii (1996). Supergrass sounded like the heirs to the Buzzcocks, at least on I…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":8824085396818,"type":"album","name":"Santa Barbara","list_id":212407470817145,"list":"RYM Top — Pop — Sophisti-Pop","src":"musthear","rank":167,"year":1992,"note":null,"yt":"0638G_g4tfg","scaruffi":null},{"id":8824085396818,"type":"album","name":"Santa Barbara","list_id":82958032046503,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Soft Rock","src":"musthear","rank":119,"year":1992,"note":null,"yt":"0638G_g4tfg","scaruffi":null},{"id":161028061741986,"type":"album","name":"Gideon Gaye","list_id":28572826268451,"list":"RYM Top — Pop — Chamber Pop","src":"musthear","rank":123,"year":1994,"note":null,"yt":"CJmTbV0CKIg","scaruffi":null},{"id":161028061741986,"type":"album","name":"Gideon Gaye","list_id":213382009109123,"list":"RYM Top — Pop — Sunshine Pop","src":"musthear","rank":14,"year":1994,"note":null,"yt":"CJmTbV0CKIg","scaruffi":null},{"id":136780087842548,"type":"album","name":"Hawaii","list_id":28572826268451,"list":"RYM Top — Pop — Chamber Pop","src":"musthear","rank":91,"year":1996,"note":null,"yt":"YekklReDLPI","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":136780087842548,"type":"album","name":"Hawaii","list_id":213382009109123,"list":"RYM Top — Pop — Sunshine Pop","src":"musthear"